mative failure that actually rules something out; a generic inconclusive response with no new evidence does not. Deduplicate by target state, tested property and method, rather than action name or repeated query. No numerical pleasure or satisfaction grant is authorized by the supplied probe record. Any existing experience implementation must enforce personal applicability, bounded event amounts and caps, cooldown and decay; do not invent an extra reward channel. This examination supplies no nutrition, healing or guaranteed comfort and cannot reduce basic nutritional requirements. Physical comfort remains capped at 10. Protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions are unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse probe interaction visuals, not a new mastery or safety badge. Associate reusable event metadata with the actual actor, target ID, mode, intensity, stage, outcome and evidence reference; show inspection or pressing only when it occurs. Distinguish completed observation, completed physical trial, inconclusive finding, failure and cancellation. Display material depletion or damage only if actually produced. Do not mark the berry safe, detoxified, nutritious or successfully tested for toxins on the basis of appearance, soil data or a press response. If suitable event/visual fields are absent, add that narrow observability support through the existing handoff; do not display success while implementation is pending.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

